o a hot, high-pressure gas. This hot gas flows through the condenser coils located on the back or bottom of the unit, where it releases the accumulated heat (including the heat absorbed from the interior and the work done by the compressor) to the surrounding room air, causing the refrigerant to condense back into a liquid. Finally, the liquid refrigerant passes through an expansion valve, which drops its pressure", "done": "DONE 192 24 452.9 5259.6 length 112 179 0", "request_wall_seconds": 5.712792484002421, "resources_before": {"memory_events": {"low": 0, "high": 0, "max": 0, "oom": 0, "oom_kill": 0, "oom_group_kill": 0, "sock_throttled": 0}, "memory_current": 42011111424, "cpu_stat": {"usage_usec": 59137947, "user_usec": 51942943, "system_usec": 7195003, "nice_usec": 0, "core_sched.force_idle_usec": 0, "nr_periods": 0, "nr_throttled": 0, "throttled_usec": 0, "nr_bursts": 0, "burst_usec": 0}, "memory_pressure": "some avg10=0.00 avg60=0.00 avg300=0.00 total=7937\nfull avg10=0.00 avg60=0.00 avg300=0.00 total=7937", "guest_cpu_ticks": [5802091, 666, 403174, 130624391, 221446, 0, 63421, 4488, 45963, 0], "process_minor_faults": 8960134, "process_major_faults": 332, "process_cpu_ticks": 5887}, "resources_after": {"memory_events": {"low": 0, "high": 0, "max": 0, "oom": 0, "oom_kill": 0, "oom_group_kill": 0, "sock_throttled": 0}, "memory_current": 42041085952, "cpu_stat": {"usage_usec": 103466095, "user_usec": 96153271, "system_usec": 7312823, "nice_usec": 0, "core_sched.force_idle_usec": 0, "nr_periods": 0, "nr_throttled": 0, "throttled_usec": 0, "nr_bursts": 0, "burst_usec": 0}, "memory_pressure": "some avg10=0.00 avg60=0.00 avg300=0.00 total=7937\nfull avg10=0.00 avg60=0.00 avg300=0.00 total=7937", "guest_cpu_ticks": [5806562, 666, 403191, 130624404, 221507, 0, 63423, 4488, 45965, 0], "process_minor_faults": 8996155, "process_major_faults": 332, "process_cpu_ticks": 10317}}
